===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|muskito||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
{{bor+|en|es|mosquito||gnat}}, diminutive of {{m|es|mosca||fly}}, from {{der|en|la|musca||fly}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*mūs-||fly, stinging fly, gnat}}. Cognate with {{cog|vls|meuzie||mosquito}}, dialectal {{cog|sv|mausa||mosquito}}, {{cog|lt|musė||a fly}} and {{cog|scn|muschitta||midge}}. See also {{l|en|midge}}. {{etydate|1580s}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/məˈski.toʊ/|a=US}}
** {{IPA|en|/məˈskitə/|a=colloquial,folk speech,nonstandard}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-mosquito.ogg|a=US}}
* {{IPA|en|/mɒˈskiː.təʊ/|a=RP}}
* {{audio|en|en-uk-mosquito.ogg|a=UK}}
